{"id":"n67701-1-13","stage":1,"title":"여름 · 夏","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67701-1-13-1","ko":"올해 여름은 작년보다 더 습하고 더운 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得今年的夏天比去年更潮湿、更热。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}},{"text":"여름은","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름은","audio":"/audio/a146cfad3f10525c9377.mp3"}},{"text":"작년보다","meaning":"去年","explanation":"작년：去年；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"작년","audio":"/audio/201b780a33a41d77aa74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30184","senseId":"1","lemma":"작년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작년보다","audio":"/audio/5145f3ee681c6c6dbbeb.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"습하고","meaning":"潮湿","explanation":"습하다：潮湿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"습하다","audio":"/audio/f9c6b95f334f5796df04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83465","senseId":"1","lemma":"습하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"습하고","audio":"/audio/a97f4cb934af1a1716c6.mp3"}},{"text":"더운","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더운","audio":"/audio/2d08b046799650114bd9.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"201b780a33a41d77","term":"작년","zh":"去年","audio":"/audio/201b780a33a41d77aa74.mp3","entryId":"30184","definition":"正经历的年份的前面一年。","pronunciation":["장년"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"f9c6b95f334f5796","term":"습하다","zh":"潮湿","audio":"/audio/f9c6b95f334f5796df04.mp3","entryId":"83465","definition":"不干燥，水汽重，湿润。","pronunciation":["스파다"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8fa903184d1f120e4fec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67701-1-13-2","ko":"응, 날씨가 진짜 무덥다.","zh":"是啊，天气真的热得要命。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"진짜","meaning":"真的","explanation":"진짜：真的。","readings":[{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71539","senseId":"1","lemma":"진짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}},{"text":"무덥다.","meaning":"湿热，闷热","explanation":"무덥다：湿热，闷热；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"무덥다","audio":"/audio/d6cafefe3c139bd3dc57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15322","senseId":"1","lemma":"무덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무덥다","audio":"/audio/d6cafefe3c139bd3dc57.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"79eea25f740b5721","term":"진짜","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3","entryId":"71539","definition":"没有假装或虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["진짜"]},{"id":"d6cafefe3c139bd3","te